message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "Code and data for: Coverage and Homogenization Crossovers in Nonlinear Spreading on Bounded Domains: Separating Diffusion, Normalization and Confinement"
abstract: "Simulator, free-space reference solver, run scripts, analysis scripts, per-run summaries and time series for the susceptible-infected reaction-diffusion model with a localized transmission hotspot on bounded domains (folder CNSNS_revision; release cnsns-r2 corresponds to the second revision of manuscript CNSNS-D-26-02308). The repository root also holds the simulation code of an earlier study of the same group."
